0..72 Comment "// A role that requires the older version of a store\'s signature, twice."
73..75 Comment "//"
76..153 Comment "// A program and its sites change on their own schedules. A deployment states"
154..205 Comment "// how a newer module answers an older requirement."
206..208 Comment "//"
209..284 Comment "// `far` requires two stores of strings at the older signature, which reads"
285..355 Comment "// by `get`: `store` and `cache`. A site whose module models the newer"
356..428 Comment "// signature answers each one only through a translation. The manifold\'s"
429..467 Comment "// policy must admit each translation."
468..470 Comment "//"
471..550 Comment "// - see: `translated.versions.gandr` — the two versions and the flow between"
551..560 Comment "//   them"
561..636 Comment "// - see: `translated.site.gandr` — a site that answers `store` through a"
637..673 Comment "//   renaming and `cache` via a flow"
674..748 Comment "// - see: `translated.manifold.gandr` — `far` at that site, under `Path`"
749..828 Comment "// - see: `corpus/pathological/worlds/translated.gandr` — a translation under"
829..858 Comment "//   `Exact`, refused by name"
859..934 Comment "// - see: `corpus/pathological/worlds/rewritten.gandr` — a flow with code"
935..975 Comment "//   under `Path`, refused at its member"
977..996 Comment "// The older store."
